+**Pattern**: Run the actual migration chain against disposable clean and dirty shapes, then inspect database constraints/indexes rather than asserting ORM metadata.
+
+**Acceptance predicate**: Before the migration exists, the probe fails because the table and required constraints are absent; after implementation it proves clean apply, forward apply, and a single migration head.
