+- [ ] T003 [P] Write failing request-path tests for `POST /callbacks/reminder`: missing/malformed/invalid signatures are rejected without persistence; a valid signed callback persists its workspace-scoped status; replaying the same provider event id succeeds without a second event or repeated transition.
+
+**Implements**: R1, R2, R3.
+
+**Pattern**: Construct provider payloads with the repository’s real signature helper and assert through the callback endpoint plus a request-role readback; do not call the service directly as the only proof.
