+**Pattern**: Exercise the HTTP endpoint with two real workspace principals and fixture actions, never a privileged database role or mocked tenant predicate.
+
+**Acceptance predicate**: The test proves both the permitted and cross-workspace denial paths before the endpoint is implemented.
