+**Implements**: R2, R3.
+
+**Pattern**: Perform event creation and action status update in one database transaction; treat database uniqueness as authoritative under concurrent callbacks.
+
+**Acceptance predicate**: A valid first callback records one workspace-scoped event; a replay leaves event count and action transition count unchanged.
+
+**Test command**: Repository integration-test command narrowed to `tests/integration/test_reminder_callback.py`.
