+**Implements**: R1, R2, R3.
+
+**Pattern**: Keep the endpoint thin: authentication and mutation rules stay in the dedicated modules; do not expose internal workspace identifiers or secrets in errors.
+
+**Acceptance predicate**: All callback request-path tests pass, including invalid signature, valid delivery, and duplicate replay.
+
+**Test command**: Repository integration-test command narrowed to `tests/integration/test_reminder_callback.py`.
